# The fields and types of references, as the form shows them, in English.
# The names are those of BibLaTeX: `field-journaltitle` is what the form
# calls the field `journaltitle`, and `field-type-article` the type
# `article`. The English is that of resources/biblatex/schema.json, which
# says what the fields and types are; a test keeps the two alike.
# See locales/README.md.

## The groups of fields, in the menu that adds a field.

field-group-people = Люди
field-group-titles = Названия
field-group-publication = Публикация
field-group-identifiers = Идентификаторы
field-group-language = Язык
field-group-notes = Примечания
field-group-relations = Связи
field-group-sorting = Сортировка
field-group-other = Прочее

